<title>UK: EIB adds 100 million stg to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 100 million stg to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by lead manager HSBC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *700 MLN STG   COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    07.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.552   PAY DATE  **11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 09.JAN.96 AND INCREASED</p>
<p>		ON 25.SEP.96.</p>
<p>	    **PLUS FOUR DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-500  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  0.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
